---
import type { Language } from '@/i18n';
interface Props { lang: Language }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isVi = lang === 'vi';
---

<section class="rounded-3xl border border-cyan-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 via-white to-violet-50 p-6 dark:border-cyan-500/20 dark:from-cyan-950/30 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-violet-950/20 sm:p-8">
  <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300">AgentKit interoperability</p>
  <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">{isVi ? 'Chọn đúng loại migration' : 'Choose the correct migration lane'}</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{isVi ? 'Ba workflow có tên gần giống nhau nhưng thay đổi những thứ khác nhau. Không dùng ak migrate như lệnh chuyển provider.' : 'Three similarly named workflows change different things. Do not use ak migrate as a provider-conversion command.'}</p>
  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-violet-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-violet-500/20 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300">01 · CK → AK</span><h2 class="mt-2 font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{isVi ? 'CLI và kit migration' : 'CLI and kit migration'}</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{isVi ? 'Chuyển legacy ck install sang AgentKit. Hub /guides/agentkit sở hữu workflow này.' : 'Move a legacy ck install to AgentKit. The /guides/agentkit hub owns this workflow.'}</p><a href={isVi ? '/vi/guides/agentkit' : '/guides/agentkit'} class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg px-1 text-sm font-semibold text-violet-700 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-violet-900 hover:underline focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-violet-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 active:text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-300 dark:hover:text-violet-100">{isVi ? 'Mở checklist' : 'Open checklist'} →</a></article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-cyan-500/20 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300">02 · target install</span><h2 class="mt-2 font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">Claude Code / Codex</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{isVi ? 'Cài cùng AgentKit kit vào target coding agent đã được xác minh.' : 'Install the same AgentKit kit into a verified coding-agent target.'}</p><a href={isVi ? '/vi/guides/ck-with-codex' : '/guides/ck-with-codex'} class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg px-1 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-700 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-cyan-900 hover:underline focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 active:text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-300 dark:hover:text-cyan-100">AgentKit × Codex →</a></article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-amber-500/20 dark:bg-slate-900"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300">03 · runtime</span><h2 class="mt-2 font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">CCS profiles</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{isVi ? 'CCS chuyển runtime/profile. ccs migrate là lệnh riêng của CCS, không phải AgentKit migration.' : 'CCS switches runtime profiles. ccs migrate belongs to CCS; it is not AgentKit migration.'}</p><a href={isVi ? '/vi/guides/ccs' : '/guides/ccs'} class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg px-1 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-700 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-amber-900 hover:underline focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-amber-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 active:text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-300 dark:hover:text-amber-100">{isVi ? 'Mở CCS guide' : 'Open CCS guide'} →</a></article>
  </div>
</section>
